"Rescue a Damsel in Distress and return with her to Wilbur Humphrey in Castle Ironfist."
msgstr ""
"Rette eine Maid in Not und kehre mit ihr zu Wilbur Humphrey in Burg Ironfist zurück."

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:1114
msgid ""
"Slay Longfang Witherhide in his cave near Castle Darkmoor and return to Wilbur Humphrey in Castle Ironfist."
msgstr ""
"Erschlage Longfang Witherhide in seiner Höhle bei Burg Darkmoor und kehre zurück zu Wilbur Humphrey in Burg Ironfist."

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:1115
msgid "Entertain Nicolai."
msgstr "Unterhalte Nicolai."

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:112
msgid ""
"Bring Hiss on the Dagger Wound Islands the Idol of the Snake from the Abandoned Temple."
msgstr ""
"Bringt Hiss auf den Dolchwunden-Inseln den Götzen der Schlange aus dem Verlassenen Tempel."

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
# address made plural (Claude)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:1120
msgid "Find and return Prince Nicolai to Castle Ironfist."
msgstr "Findet Prinz Nicolai und bringt ihn zurück nach Burg Ironfist."

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
# address made plural (Claude)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:1121
msgid "Find the Third Eye and bring it to Prince Nicolai in Castle Ironfist."
msgstr ""
"Findet das dritte Auge und bringt es zu Prinz Nicolai in Burg Ironfist."

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:1123
msgid ""
"Capture the Prince of Thieves and bring him to Lord Anthony Stone at Castle Stone."
msgstr ""
"Fange den Prinzen der Diebe und bringe ihn zu Lord Anthony Stone in Burg Stone."

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:1130
msgid ""
"Hire a Stonecutter and a Carpenter, bring them to Temple Stone in Free Haven to repair the Temple, and then return to Lord Anthony Stone at Castle Stone."
msgstr ""
"Heuere einen Steinmetz und einen Zimmermann an, bringe sie zum Tempel Stone, repariere den Tempel und kehre dann zu Lord Stone in Burg Stone zurück."

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/quests.txt:1132
