msgstr "Kolonie Zod - Schlüssel"

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1467
msgid "Faerie Key"
msgstr "Feenschlüssel"

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1468
msgid ""
"Been looking for this?  No wonder it wasn't in the sewers… it was hiding out in Erathia the whole time."
msgstr ""
"Danach gesucht? Kein Wunder, daß er nicht in den Abwasserkanälen war…er hatte sich die ganze Zeit draußen in Erathia versteckt."

