msgid "Gem"
msgstr "Edelstein"

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:626
msgid "Gem of Restoration"
msgstr "Edelstein der Wiederherstellung"

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:626
msgid ""
"Quest Item: This large ruby is of perfect quality, clear throughout with an even pigeon blood red. It contains a powerful enchantment and pulses with a slumbering heartbeat rhythm."
msgstr ""
"Wichtiger Gegenstand: Dieser große Rubin ist von perfekter Qualität, durch und durch klar und von gleichmäßig blutroter Farbe. In ihm ist ein mächtiger Zauber eingeschlossen und pulsiert dort im verschlafenen Rhythmus eines Herzens."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:627
msgid "Charged connector stone"
msgstr "Geladener Verbindungsstein"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:627
msgid "Smooth half-transparent connector stone charged by time traveling."
msgstr ""
"Glatter, halb durchsichtiger Verbindungsstein, durch Zeitreisen aufgeladen."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:628
msgid "Connector stone"
msgstr "Verbindungsstein"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:628
msgid "Smooth stone without specific color."
msgstr "Glatter Stein ohne bestimmte Farbe."

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:629
msgid ""
"Quest Item: The writing inside this book reads like the ranting of a madman. Still, someone must have thought highly of it. The text is entirely hand scribed in a florid style. Inset illuminations bring to life scenes from the story which are, in turn, disturbing, outlandish or seemingly drawn from nightmare."
msgstr ""
"Wichtiger Gegenstand: Der Inhalt dieses Buches liest sich wie das leere Gerede eines Verrückten. Und doch muß jemand davon eine hohe Meinung gehabt haben. Der Text ist in einem blumigen Stil komplett handschriftlich niedergeschrieben worden. Eingefügte Kolorierungen erwecken Szenen des Buches zum Leben, die allerdings beunruhigend, fremdländisch oder wie aus einem Albtraum erscheinen."

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:63
msgid ""
"Dark Elven bowsmiths have discovered that unusual characteristics of the Kreegan spinal column make it the best material for heavy bowstaves. A clever arrangement of composite pulleys make it possible for those of less than superhuman strength to pull these mighty weapons."
msgstr ""
"Die Waffenschmiede der Dunkelelfen haben festgestellt, daß die ungewöhnlichen Eigenschaften des Rückgrats der Kreegan es zu einem hervorragenden Material für Bögen machen. Eine kluge Anordnung aus Rollen ermöglicht es auch denen, die keine übermenschlichen Kräfte besitzen, die Sehne dieser mächtigen Waffe zu spannen."

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:63
msgid "Devilbone Bow"
msgstr "Teufelsknochen -Bogen"

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:630
msgid ""
"Quest Item: The remains of Korbu who some claim was the most powerful vampire of all times. He's not much to look at now, however. His skeleton has been almost completely dismantled--either by design or the ravages of time, and a wooden stake is nestled entirely within the ribcage."
msgstr ""
"Wichtiger Gegenstand: Die Überreste Korbus, von dem einige sagen, daß er der Mächtigste der Rasse der Vampire gewesen sei. Momentan sieht er allerdings nicht besonders beeindruckend aus. Sein Skelett ist fast komplett zerlegt - entweder absichtlich oder aufgrund des Zahns der Zeit - und ein hölzerner Pfahl nimmt fast seinen gesamten Brustkorb ein."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:630
msgid "Remains"
msgstr "Überreste"

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:630
msgid "Remains of Korbu"
msgstr "Überreste Korbus"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1406 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1420 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1433
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:631
msgid "Jar"
msgstr "Gefäß"

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1406 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1420 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:631
msgid "Lich Jar"
msgstr "Lich Gefäß"

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:631
msgid "Quest Item: A well made jar."
msgstr "Wichtiger Gegenstand: Ein schön gearbeitetes Gefäß"

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:632
msgid ""
"Quest Item: Both the keys and ring are made of a metal you've never encountered before. The gemstones inset in the key heads are familiar to you. They are elemental heartstones like those incorporated in the conflux key Xanthor made for you."
msgstr ""
"Wichtiger Gegenstand: Sowohl die Schlüssel als auch der Ring wurden aus einem Metall gefertigt, das Ihr nie zuvor gesehen habt. Die Edelsteine, die in diesen Schlüssel eingearbeitet sind, kommen Euch bekannt vor. Es sind Herzsteine der vier Elemente, so wie jene, die Xanthor in den Konflux-Schlüssel eingearbeitet hat, den er für Euch gefertigt hat."

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:632
msgid "Ring of Keys"
msgstr "Ring der Schlüssel"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:633
msgid "Idol"
msgstr "Götzenbild"

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:633
msgid "Idol of the Snake"
msgstr "Götze der Schlange"

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:633
msgid ""
"Quest Item: An Idol of the ancient snake god who was worshipped by the Serpentmen who used to dwell on the Dagger Wound Islands."
msgstr ""
"Wichtiger Gegenstand: Eine Götze des altertümlichen Schlangengottes, der von den Schlangenmenschen verehrt wurde, die einst auf den Dolchwunden-Inseln lebten."

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:634
msgid "Big Brass Ring"
msgstr "Großer Messingring"

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:634
msgid ""
"Quest Item: A large ring of polished brass. It seems to be part of a door knocker."
msgstr ""
"Wichtiger Gegenstand: Ein großer Ring aus poliertem Messing. Er scheint Teil eines Türklopfers zu sein."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:635
msgid "Hide"
msgstr "Haut"

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:635
msgid "Naga Hide"
msgstr "Naga-Haut"

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:635
msgid "The skinned and scraped hide of a naga."
msgstr "Die abgezogene und geschabte Haut eines Naga."

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:636
msgid "Dire Wolf Pelt"
msgstr "Schreckens wolf -Pelze"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:636
msgid "Pelt"
msgstr "Fell"

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:636
msgid "The skinned and scraped hide of a dire wolf."
msgstr "Die abgezogene und geschabte Haut eines Schreckenswolfes."

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2101 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:637
msgid "Flute"
msgstr "Flöte"

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:637
msgid "Quest Item: A well crafted instrument."
msgstr "Wichtiger Gegenstand: Ein sehr schön gearbeitetes Instrument."

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:638
msgid "A jar of royal wasp jelly."
msgstr "Ein Gefäß Königlichem Wespengelees."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:638
msgid "Jelly"
msgstr "Gelee"

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:639
msgid "Dragonbane Flower"
msgstr "Drachen fluch -Blume"

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:639
msgid "Quest Item: A fresh dragonbane flower. The petals are thick and waxy."
msgstr ""
"Wichtiger Gegenstand: Eine frisch gepflückte Drachenfluch-Blume. Die Blüten sind dick und wächsern."

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:64
msgid ""
"Because of their ease of use, crossbows like these are stockpiled in militia armories everywhere. Their low pull strength and mediocre workmanship however, make them only moderately effective."
msgstr ""
"Da sie einfach zu handhaben sind, findet man Armbrüste wie diese in den Waffenkammern aller Milizen des Landes. Die geringe Sehnenspannung und die mäßige Verarbeitung reichen allerdings nur für eine mittelmäßige Effektivität."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1652 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1653 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1654
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:64 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:65 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:66
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:67 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:68 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:852
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:853 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:854
msgid "Crossbow"
msgstr "Armbrust"

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:64
msgid "Light Crossbow"
msgstr "Leichte Armbrust"

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:640
msgid "Bone of Doom"
msgstr "Knochen des Verderbens"

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:640
msgid ""
"Quest Item: The arm bone of the legendary necromancer, Zacharia. It is infused with the death magician's evil energy."
msgstr ""
"Wichtiger Gegenstand: Der Armknochen des legendären Nekromanten Zacharia. Er ist durchwirkt mit der finsteren Energie des verstorbenen Magiers."

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:641
msgid ""
"A legendary item rumored to be from the time of the Ancients.  Only someone with the power of a Grand Druid can wear this item."
msgstr ""
"Ein legendärer Gegenstand, der noch aus der Zeit der Alten stammt.  Nur jemand mit der Macht eines Großdruiden ist in der Lage, diesen Gegenstand zu tragen."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:641
msgid "Circlet"
msgstr "Stirnreif"

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:641
msgid "Druid Circlet of Power"
msgstr "Druidendiadem der Macht"

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:642
msgid "Arcane Key"
msgstr "Arkaner Schlüssel"

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:642 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:644
msgid "Quest Item: A gem containing an unfocused magical energy."
msgstr ""
"Wichtiger Gegenstand: Ein Edelstein mit einer ungezielten magischen Energie."

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:643
msgid "A horn taken from a wyvern."
msgstr "Ein Horn eines Wyvern."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2058 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:643
msgid "Horn"
msgstr "Horn"

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:643
msgid "Wyvern Horn"
msgstr "Horn eines Wyvern"

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:644
msgid "Ogre Key"
msgstr "Oger Schlüssel"

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:645
msgid "Pirate Hat"
msgstr "Piratenhut"

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:645
msgid ""
"Quest Item: A sea raider captain's hat. Inside the band are stitched the words \"D. P. Stanley.\""
msgstr ""
"Wichtiger Gegenstand: Der Hut eines Seeräuberkapitäns. Auf der Hutschnur sind die Worte D. P. Stanley eingraviert."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:646
msgid "Fruit"
msgstr "Frucht"

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:646
msgid ""
"The fruit of the tobersk bush which only grows on the Dagger Wound Islands. It is the main export item of the islands' Lizardmen."
msgstr ""
"Die Frucht des Tobersk-Busches, der nur auf der Dolchwunden-Insel wächst. Sie sind der Hauptexportartikel der auf der Insel ansässigen Echsenmänner."

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:646
msgid "Tobersk Fruit"
msgstr "Tobersk-Frucht"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:647
msgid "Pulp"
msgstr "Fruchtmark"

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:647
msgid "Pulp made from Dagger Wound Islands grown tobersk fruit."
msgstr ""
"Mark, das aus der auf der Dolchwunden-Insel wachsenden Tobersk-Frucht gewonnen wird."

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:647
msgid "Tobersk Pulp"
msgstr "Tobersk-Mark"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:648
msgid "Brandy"
msgstr "Branntwein"

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:648
msgid ""
"Brandy made from the processed pulp of Dagger Wound Islands grown tobersk fruit."
msgstr ""
"Brandy, der aus dem weiterverarbeiteten Mark der Tobersk-Frucht, die auf den Dolchwunden-Inseln wächst, gewonnen wird."

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:648
msgid "Tobersk Brandy"
msgstr "Tobersk-Brandy"

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:649
msgid "Heartwood of Jadame"
msgstr "Herzholz von Jadame"

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:649
msgid ""
"The cooler climate of the Murmurwood forest causes the trees there to grow with a tight grain. These lumbered planks are of the clear grained heartwood."
msgstr ""
"Durch das kühlere Klima des Murmelwalds haben die Bäume eine ganz besondere Maserung. Diese aufbereiteten Planken sind aus Herzholz mit einer kleinen Maserung gefertigt."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:649
msgid "Wood"
msgstr "Holz"

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:65
msgid ""
"A light crossbow of good quality, these weapons feature a grooved table, basic sights and a smooth releasing nut."
msgstr ""
"Eine leichte Armbrust guter Qualität, die über eine eingekerbte Auflage, ein einfaches Visier und einen guten Auslösemechanismus verfügt."

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:65
msgid "Blood Drop Crossbow"
msgstr "Blutstropfen -Armbrust"

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:650
msgid ""
"A crate of from the Shadowspire artificers. Small flaws in workmanship have made them incapable of holding enchantments."
msgstr ""
"Eine Kiste der Handwerker von Schattensumpf. Durch kleine Mängel in der Verarbeitung sind diese Amulette nicht in der Lage, Verwünschungen zu enthalten."

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1497 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1498 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1499
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1500 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1501 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1502
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:650 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:651 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:652
msgid "Crate"
msgstr "Truhe"

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:650
msgid "Flawed Amulets"
msgstr "Fehlerhafte Amulette"

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:651
msgid ""
"A crate of dried sunfish harvested from the Ifarine Sea. Some find the chewy, salty fish a delicacy."
msgstr ""
"Eine Kiste getrockneten Sonnenfisches, der im ifarinischen Meer gefangen wurde. Einige sehen diesen zähen, salzigen Fisch als Delikatesse an."

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:651
msgid "Dried Sunfish"
msgstr "Getrockneter Sonnenfisch"

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:652
msgid ""
"A crate full of bagged Silver Dust. Made by the Necromancers' Guild, it is said to have value to some sea travelers."
msgstr ""
"Eine Kiste mit abgepacktem Silberstaub. Von der Gilde der Nekromanten hergestellt, wird ihm nachgesagt, für Seereisende einigen Wert zu besitzen."

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:652
msgid "Silver Dust of the Sea"
msgstr "Silberstaub der See"

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:653
msgid "Forged Vouchers"
msgstr "Gefälschte Kreditgutscheine"

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:653
msgid ""
"Forged credit documents used by the ogre mage Zog to embezzle gold from Alvarian merchant customers."
msgstr ""
"Gefälschte Kreditunterlagen, die von dem Oger-Magier Zog dazu verwendet wurden, Gold der alvarianischen Händler zu unterschlagen."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:653
msgid "Vouchers"
msgstr "Gutscheine"

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:654
msgid "A powerful potion reagent used by the Necromancers of Shadowspire."
msgstr ""
"Ein sehr wirksamer Grundbestandteil für Tränke, der von den Nekromanten von Schattensumpf verwendet wird."

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:654
msgid "Ground Wyvern Horn"
msgstr "Horn eines Bodenwyvern"

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:655
msgid "Prophecies of the Snake"
msgstr "Prophezeiungen der Schlange"

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:655
msgid ""
"Quest Item: One of many books of prophecy circulating recently, the Prophecies of the Snake may indeed tell the future of Jadame."
msgstr ""
"Wichtiger Gegenstand: Die Prophezeiungen der Schlange, eines der vielen Bücher der Prophezeiung, die in letzter Zeit in Umlauf kamen, könnte sehr wohl die Zukunft Jadames schildern."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:656
msgid "Ear"
msgstr "Ohr"

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:656
msgid "Ogre Ear"
msgstr "Ohr eines Oger"

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:656
msgid ""
"Used to keep track of kills, some bounty hunters collect these gruesome reminders of battles past."
msgstr ""
"Einige Kopfgeldjäger sammeln diese gräßlichen Erinnerungsstücke vergangener Schlachten, um so über die Anzahl der getöteten Oger auf dem Laufenden zu halten."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:657
msgid "Stinger"
msgstr "Stachel"

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:657
msgid "The stinger of a giant wasp."
msgstr "Der Stachel einer riesigen Wespe."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1435 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2107 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:658
msgid "Apple"
msgstr "Apfel"

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:658
msgid "Green Apple"
msgstr "Grüner Apfel"

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:658
msgid ""
"Jadamean green apples are crunchy, slightly tart and a good source of nutrition.  (To use the apple, pick it up and left-click over a character's portrait in the inventory screen.)"
msgstr ""
"Die grünen Äpfel Jadames sind knackig, etwas säuerlich und eine gute Quelle für gesunde Ernährung.  (Um diesen Apfel zu verwenden, müßt Ihr ihn aufnehmen und mit der rechten Maustaste auf das Portrait eines Charakters im Inventarbildschirm klicken)."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:1451 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:2086 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:659
msgid "Horseshoe"
msgstr "Hufeisen"

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:659
msgid ""
"This flawless horseshoe is made of silver. To use, pick the horseshoe up and right-click over a character's portrait."
msgstr ""
"Dieses makellose Hufeisen wurde aus Silber hergestellt.  (Um es zu verwenden, müßt Ihr das Hufeisen aufheben und mit der rechten Maustaste auf das Portrait eines Charakters klicken.)"

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:66
msgid ""
"Built for use in the field, this medium crossbow is designed for hunting, but is equally effective as a battle weapon."
msgstr ""
"Diese mittelschwere Armbrust wird eigentlich bei der Jagd eingesetzt, eignet sich aber auch für den Kampf."

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:66
msgid "Hunting Crossbow"
msgstr "Jagd-Armbrust"

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:660
msgid ""
"A pretty bauble favored by the Pirates of Regna for it appearance, not for any magical enchantment it may have."
msgstr ""
"Ein hübscher Plunder, der nicht wegen etwaigen darin befindlichen Zaubers von den regnanischen Piraten bevorzugt wird, sondern wegen seines Aussehens."

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:660 assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/tables/english/potion.txt:119 assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/tables/english/potion.txt:120
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/tables/english/potion.txt:121 assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/tables/english/potion.txt:122 assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/tables/english/potion.txt:123
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/tables/english/potion.txt:124 assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/tables/english/potion.txt:125
msgid "Enchanted Amulet"
msgstr "Verzaubertes Amulett"

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:661
msgid ""
"Quest Item: A wheel of prized unicorn's-milk frelandeau cheese. Sliced onto crackers, it is the perfect compliment to a snifter of fine tobersk brandy."
msgstr ""
"Wichtiger Gegenstand: Ein Rad des preisgekrönten, aus Einhorn-Milch hergestellten Frelandeau-Käses. Geschnitten und auf Cracker gelegt, ist es das Ideale zu einem edlen Tobersk-Brandy."

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:661 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:803
msgid "Wheel of Frelandeau"
msgstr "Rad Frelandeau"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:662 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:804
msgid "Log of Eldenbrie"
msgstr "Laib Eldenbrie"

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:662
msgid ""
"Quest Item: A log of Vori eldenbrie cheese. Though many have tried to duplicate its subtle, smoky flavor, only the master Frost Giant cheese masters of the frozen Vori wastes know the secrets of its formulation."
msgstr ""
"Wichtiger Gegenstand: Ein Stück Eldenbrie-Käse. Obwohl viele versuchten, seinen feinen, rauchigen Geschmack zu imitieren, wissen nur die Käsemeister der Vori Eisriesen um das geheime Rezept dieses Käses."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:663 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:805
msgid "Ball of Dunduck"
msgstr "Kugel Dunduck"

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:663
msgid ""
"Quest Item: A ball of dunduck cheese. Made in small batches by the goblins of Erathia, most consider it an acquired taste."
msgstr ""
"Wichtiger Gegenstand: Eine Kugel Dunduck-Käse. Einige möchten den Geschmack dieses Käses, der von den Goblins schubweise hergestellt wird, gar nicht mehr missen."

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:664
msgid "Emperor Thorn's Key"
msgstr "Schlüssel des Imperators Thorn"

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:664
msgid "Quest Item: The key you took from the Unicorn King's body."
msgstr ""
"Wichtiger Gegenstand: Der Schlüssel, den Ihr vom Körper des Einhornkönigs genommen habt."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:665
msgid "Cannonball"
msgstr "Kanonenkugel"

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:665
msgid "Cannonball of Dominion"
msgstr "Kanonenkugel der Herrschaft"

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:665
msgid ""
"Quest Item: The strange cannonball you took from the Regnan fortress. It is unlike any ammunition you've seen before."
msgstr ""
"Wichtiger Gegenstand: Die merkwürdige Kanonenkugel, den Ihr aus der regnanischen Festung mitgenommen habt. Sie hat keinerlei Ähnlichkeit mit irgendeiner Munition, die Ihr vorher gesehen habt."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:666
msgid "Infused Metal Rod"
msgstr "Aufgeladener Metallstab"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:666
msgid "Metal Rod"
msgstr "Metallstab"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:666
msgid "Metal stick."
msgstr "Ein Metallstab."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:667
msgid "Large Round Crystal"
msgstr "Großer runder Kristall"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:667
msgid "Large smooth and perfectly round crystal."
msgstr "Großer, glatter und vollkommen runder Kristall."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/items.txt:667
msgid "Round crystal"
msgstr "Runder Kristall"

