# imported from GRfix (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:809
msgid ""
"With Expert Earth Magic you can learn all of the Expert spells for this element.\n"
"Higher level spells may prove more potent and of greater assistance to your party.\n"
"Expert Earth Magic can be yours if you have a skill level of 4 in Earth Magic and can pay the price of 1000 gold."
msgstr ""
