# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:289 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:1105
msgid ""
"Ah, you returned Balthazar's Axe with my certificate to Tessalar!\n"
"The Rites of Purity have begun.\n"
"Soon Lord Masul will wield his father's axe as his own!\n"
"Greatness will return to my herd!"
msgstr ""
"Ah, Ihr habt Balthazars Axt mit meiner Echtheitsurkunde nach Tessalar gebracht! Die Riten der Reinheit haben begonnen. Bald wird Lord Masul die Axt seines Vaters wie seine eigene schwingen! Meine Herde wird wieder bedeutend sein!"

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3871 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11053
msgid ""
"The Grandmaster of the Identify Item skill, Payge Blueswan, can be found in the elven territory of Avlee.\n"
"His home is just northwest of the elven city of Spaward."
msgstr ""
"Payge Blauschwan, Großmeister des Erkennens, lebt im Nordwesten der Elfenstadt Spaward in Avlee."

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/autonote.txt:362 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3873 assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11058
msgid ""
"The Master of the Merchant skill, Berthold Caverhill, can be found on the eastern most island of the Evenmorn Islands."
msgstr ""
"Bethold Höhlenberg, Meister des Feilschens, lebt östlich auf der Evenmorn Insel."

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/autonote.txt:363 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/english/autonote.txt:364 assets_dev/engine/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:3874
#: assets_dev/engine/events/Global.lua:11063
msgid ""
