# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/data/texts.yml:1056
msgid ""
"Seraphim: every hit you take is reduced by <good>{school_flat_cut}</> damage after resistances, which shrugs off light hits and softens heavy ones."
