"A switch: while it is on, your attacks leech twice as much life as Blood Leech, at 12 spell points a hit."
msgstr ""
"Ein Schalter: Solange er eingeschaltet ist, entziehen Eure Angriffe doppelt so viel Leben wie Blutsauger, für 12 Zauberpunkte pro Treffer."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/engine/rulesets/maw/data/texts.yml:612
