# machine translation (Claude), review
#~ msgid "When it comes in,"
#~ msgstr "Wenn er hereinzieht,"

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#~ msgid ""
#~ "My friends! I found it! The Runaway Chaos! Or maybe… maybe it found me? I don’t know, I don’t know, it all feels like a grand jest. It surrounded me with hellish creatures, monsters born of my nightmares. To scare me, perhaps, or just see what I would do. I fought to stay alive and it just laughed. As I say these words, I hear echoes of this screeching laughter piercing through my very skull. And when I finally fell to the ground, without a shred of power left to carry on, suddenly the nightmares… dissipated. Gone, every single one. But the wounds they left were real… and yet, when I looked down, there wasn’t a single cut. Only my torn clothes stood as proof that anything had happened at all."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Friend! I'm sure, I had contact with that 'Runaway Chaos', felt myself joshed. He tried to scare me: summoned monsters around and laughed. At the end he healed my wounds and proposed me a riddle. Promised to fulfill any my wish if I'll solve five, but I did not know answers and he disappeared. Don't know, maybe he felt himself in debt."

# machine translation (Claude), review
#~ msgid "Well, I have no skills to offer, but I'm good company!"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Nun, Fähigkeiten habe ich keine zu bieten, aber ich bin eine gute Gesellschaft!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#~ msgid "Profession texts"
#~ msgstr "Berufstexte"

# imported from GR (MMMerge localization)
#~ msgid ""
#~ "I'll happily join you for 200 gold and %17 percent of all the gold we find."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Ich suche Arbeit. Ich repariere Rüstungen und verlange nur 200 Gold und %17 Prozent des Goldes, das wir finden. Du wirst es nicht bereuen, mich mitzunehmen!"

# machine translation (Claude), review
